        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rYour target is Hui Hou, formerly a senior engineer at Trigix Enterprise, a Swedish pharmaceutical company with significant interests in China.\r\rFollowing his departure, Hou fled with classified documents detailing illicit business dealings that could severely damage Trigix’s reputation. He is believed to be preparing to release the information, leaving the company with little choice but to act.\r\rTrigix demands complete discretion. Leave no trace of their involvement.",
